        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.9.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 9:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omu biro ebyo omu rurembo Shushani, hakaba harimu Omuyudaaya orikwetwa Morodekai, mwene Yairi, mwijukuru wa Shimei, mwene Kiishi Omubenyamiini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.24.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bag 24:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.24.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.24.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 24:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.29.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "29:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.29.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omushaija ogwo akaba anyagirwe Yerusaalemu, atwairwe n'ezindi nkwatwa, na Yekonia omugabe wa Yuda, ou Nebukadeneeza omugabe wa Babulooni yaatwaire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Morodekai ogwo akoorora Hadasa muhara wa ishento, niwe Esteeri; ahabw'okuba akaba ari efuuzi, ataine ishe na nyina; kandi ogwo mwishiki akaba akuzire gye, kandi ari murungi w'okureebwa. Ishe na nyina ku baaherize kufa, Morodekai yaamutwara, yaamworora nk'omwana we ou ayezaariire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima ekiragiro ky'omugabe, ku kyaherize kubuga, abaishiki baingi baateeranirwa omu rurembo Shushani kurindwa Hegai; na Esteeri yaatwarwa omu kikaari ky'omugabe, yaakwatsibwa Hegai omurinzi w'abakazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogwo mwishiki yaasiimwa Hegai, yaamugiraho obuganzi. Hegai yaarahuka kumuha eby'okwecuma, n'egabo ye, n'abazaana mushanju abaarugire omu kikaari ky'omugabe, abu yaabaire ashemereire kuheebwa; yaamutoorana omu bandi, yaamutwara n'abazaana be, yaamuta omu mwanya ogurikukira oburungi omu nju y'abakazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Esteeri ogwo akaba atakagambaga ihanga rye, n'obu baakuba beene waabo; ahabw'okuba Morodekai akaba amwehanangiriize kutabigamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Morodekai akaba agyendagyenda obutoosha omu maisho g'ekikaari ky'enju y'abakazi, ngu amanye Esteeri oku ari, kandi n'oku ariba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi omwishiki ku yaabaire aheza ameezi ikumi n'abiri naayecuma nk'ebiragiro by'abakazi oku biri, akaba amurikirwa omugabe Ahasuero; ahakuba ameezi ago nigo gaabaire garagiirwa kwecumiramu, ameezi mukaaga nibeesiiga amajuta ga sumuruna, n'agndi mukaaga eby'emigaju n'amajuta ag'okwarika abakazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwishiki ku yaabaire aza kutaaha ow'omugabe, aheebwa ekintu kyona eki arikwenda omu nju y'abakazi kugyendana omu kikaari ky'omugabe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EST.4.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Est 4:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Akaba azayo omu mwabazyo, agaruka omu kasheeshe, ataaha omu nju y'abakazi eya kabiri, akwatsibwa Shaashigazi omukonwa w'omugabe, owaabaire arinda ebinyanshunju; akaba atagaruka w'omugabe, kureka omugabe ku yaabaire amukunda, amweta naamugamba eiziina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima obunaku bwa Esteeri, muhara wa Abihaili, ishento wa Morodekai owaamworoire nk'omwana we, bw'okumurikirwa omugabe, bwahika. Ku baamwetsire, tiyaagira ki yaashaba, kureka eki yaasiimiirwe Hegai omukonwa w'omugabe kandi omurinzi w'abakazi. Atyo Esteeri yaasiimwa boona abaamureebire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Esteeri yaatwarwa aha mugabe Ahasuero omu kikaari ky'omugabe omu kwezi kwa ikumi okurikwetwa Tebesi, omu mwaka gwe gwa mushanju agiire aha ngoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EST.1.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Est 1:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omugabe, ku yaareebire Esteeri, yaamukunda okukira abandi bakazi boona, Esteeri yaagirirwa embabazi omu maisho ge, kandi yaakundwa okukira ezo mpangare zoona; omugabe yaamujweka ekirunga aha mutwe, yaamugira omwigarire omu mwanya gwa Vasita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima omugabe yaateekyera abanyiginya be boona n'abagaragwa be obugyenyi bwingi munonga ahabwa Esteeri. Kandi yaasaasira amashaza ge goona omushoro, yaahereza ebiconco nk'omugabe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi abaishiki, ku baateerainwe obwa kabiri, Morodekai akaba ashutami aha irembo ry'omugabe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(obwo Esteeri akaba atakagambaga beene waabo nari eihanga rye, nk'oku Morodekai yaabaire amwehanangiriize; ahabw'okuba Esteeri akaba ayorobera Morodekai, nk'oku yaabaire amworobera, naakimworora).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
